    "notes": "Closed in cycle 068 via the cycle 064-067 non-autonomous lift of the §406B + §406D helper chain. The `IsConvergent` predicate (def:402A) was strengthened in cycle 068 (joint-Lipschitz on `Function.uncurry f`, global `ContDiff ℝ 1 yex`, global trajectory bound `M_bound`); see `.prover-state/issues/is_convergent_strengthened.md` for the faithfulness deviation."
